---
description: How to add or edit frontend feature modules
globs: frontend/src/features/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- One feature per folder in `frontend/src/features/<name>/index.jsx`, default-exporting `{ id, title, order, Component }`. Start from `features/_template/index.template.jsx`.
- Read shared state only through `useApp()` from `core/AppState.jsx`. Never import another feature.
- Do not edit `App.jsx` or `registry.js` to add a feature. The registry auto-discovers.
- Any new data field must be added to `docs/api-contract.sample.json` in the same change.
- Handle missing data without throwing. Show a short plain-language empty state.
- Keep farmer-facing text simple. Put dataset names and assumptions inside the expandable "Why" or source lines.
- Update the table in `docs/FEATURES.md` when adding a feature.
